{title: Give Him Your Cares}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{key: E}
{tempo: 117}

>Lyrics

Give Him your cares

Knowing that the Lord has planned the best for all His children

Trust in the Lord

Give Him your cares

Even when the road ahead leads on through tribulation

He's our Salvation

Trust in the Lord

Give Him your cares

We have got to trust in the Lord in all that we do

Look not to our own understanding, for He'll carry us through

Even in the shadow of darkness, we will know He is there

Trust in the Lord

Give Him your cares

Trust in the Lord

He's always there

(Flute duet)

Trust in the Lord, through the joy, through the tears

Lean upon the power of His love as the days turn to years

Look not to our own understanding, but in faith, and in prayer

Trust in the Lord

Give Him your cares

Trust in the Lord

He's always there!
